  "description": "Cheong-Hwa is married off to a wealthy old man who starves her to \"keep her figure trim.\" Once he dies, she's finally free to satisfy her raging hunger and eat to her heart's content. And now that she's been left alone with her pretty servant, Oh-Weol, food isn't the only thing Cheong-Hwa has a ravenous appetite for...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of Ridi's Jujonggwangye GL Danpyeonseon (주종관계 GL 단편선) Collection.*",
